WEBVTT

00:15.932 --> 00:19.144
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:51.676 --> 00:52.886
[man grunts]

00:54.721 --> 00:56.723
[ominous music]

01:09.402 --> 01:13.448
We have brought the liquor that's used
for Jinyowon's ancestral rites.

01:28.296 --> 01:30.340
The water used for the liquor changed.

01:31.299 --> 01:35.011
I mean, uh, well, you see,
due to the three-year drought,

01:35.094 --> 01:37.764
the well that we usually used
to make the ancestral rites liquor

01:37.847 --> 01:38.765
is all dried up.

01:40.308 --> 01:42.852
[dramatic music]

01:44.687 --> 01:46.064
[men yell]

01:47.857 --> 01:49.442
[man 1] But what…
[gasps]

01:50.151 --> 01:51.277
Why did you…

01:52.153 --> 01:53.196
Go make them again.

01:54.656 --> 01:55.490
Huh?

01:55.990 --> 01:58.284
But how? But we have no water!

01:58.868 --> 02:01.121
How we… how are we
supposed to make any more?

02:01.204 --> 02:05.458
If you insist, could Jinyowon
allow us to use some of their water?

02:12.715 --> 02:14.551
Only let him in for the water.

02:14.634 --> 02:17.637
- [female mage] Yes, my lady.
- Sir, but… Wait!

02:28.648 --> 02:29.482
[exhales deeply]

02:36.573 --> 02:38.616
The young lady's disappeared
from her room again.

02:38.700 --> 02:40.535
Stay right here and wait, you got it?

02:41.119 --> 02:42.370
Yes, of course.

02:45.707 --> 02:47.709
[light music playing]

02:48.710 --> 02:49.544
[exhales deeply]

02:51.087 --> 02:52.088
Beautiful!

03:02.140 --> 03:04.142
[whimsical music playing]

03:42.347 --> 03:43.348
Is there liquor in there?

03:47.560 --> 03:48.561
Oh…

03:50.521 --> 03:51.356
Here.

03:52.649 --> 03:54.651
[quirky music playing]

04:02.033 --> 04:02.867
[exhales]

04:03.868 --> 04:04.994
This is well made.

04:06.329 --> 04:07.163
Smells good!

04:08.373 --> 04:10.041
- Is there more?
- Uh…

04:10.917 --> 04:12.669
I have another bottle.

04:13.294 --> 04:14.504
Give it to me.

04:16.839 --> 04:19.259
[female mage 2] Young lady! Young lady!

04:19.342 --> 04:21.594
- [female mage 1] Search over there too.
- Hurry! Hurry, hurry, hurry!

04:21.678 --> 04:23.554
Uh-uh, here you go.

04:24.514 --> 04:25.515
Hold on! Wait!

04:33.606 --> 04:34.440
Shh!

04:37.443 --> 04:39.445
[soft music playing]

04:45.827 --> 04:46.703
Wow!

04:48.413 --> 04:49.247
Beautiful!

04:51.582 --> 04:54.168
[birds hooting]

04:55.044 --> 04:58.006
Never in my life have I ever seen
a more beautiful woman.

04:58.506 --> 05:00.008
Must have been a lady of Jinyowon.

05:00.091 --> 05:01.884
Jinyowon has one heir,

05:01.968 --> 05:04.012
and that's the Young Lady
Jin Cho-yeon we met earlier.

05:04.095 --> 05:05.305
This is Jinyowon, right?

05:06.389 --> 05:07.849
A relic's bewitched him.

05:08.599 --> 05:11.311
They've had their door closed
for three years, forbidding outsiders.

05:11.394 --> 05:12.895
There must be ghosts.

05:14.689 --> 05:16.482
- [all exhale]
- Goodness!

05:16.566 --> 05:19.110
I don't care if she was
a ghost or not, I'd like to see her again.

05:19.193 --> 05:21.779
Oh, you little brat.
Don't go tempting misfortune

05:21.863 --> 05:24.157
especially while delivering
funeral drinks.

05:24.240 --> 05:26.075
- I'm sorry, sir.
- Before we go in,

05:26.701 --> 05:28.745
take one of these.
These charms can ward off ghosts.

05:28.828 --> 05:29.787
What's this?

05:30.496 --> 05:33.458
I heard these will ward off
soul shifters as well!

05:33.541 --> 05:35.835
You remember who devastated Songrim
three years ago?

05:35.918 --> 05:37.462
The one they called Naksu.

05:37.545 --> 05:42.008
Apparently, these charms were made
with the powder of her petrified body!

05:42.091 --> 05:43.426
- Really? From Naksu's body?
- Mm.

05:43.509 --> 05:45.136
- Whoa!
- No way!

05:45.720 --> 05:48.264
Naksu's body is at the bottom
of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

05:48.347 --> 05:51.267
Come on. I can't believe
you fell for this nonsense.

05:51.350 --> 05:53.019
You wasted your money, really wasted…

05:53.102 --> 05:54.479
Oh, stop! it's…

05:56.022 --> 05:57.023
Hey, trust me!

05:57.106 --> 05:58.816
If you face a soul shifter,

05:58.900 --> 06:02.445
hold out this charm with Naksu's energy
and they go screaming like they--

06:03.112 --> 06:03.946
[screams]

06:04.781 --> 06:05.782
[both scream]

06:08.076 --> 06:09.160
Did you just do that?

06:09.243 --> 06:11.245
[suspenseful music playing]

06:15.792 --> 06:18.252
- I didn't!
- [screaming]

06:18.336 --> 06:22.423
[man 2] Wait for me!
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no! No, no, no!

06:22.507 --> 06:24.675
[man 1 whimpers]
Oh, no!

06:30.807 --> 06:32.558
[groans]

06:34.310 --> 06:37.313
[screams]
Grab a weapon!

06:37.814 --> 06:40.191
- [groans]
- What's that?

06:41.692 --> 06:43.361
[all scream]

06:48.032 --> 06:49.617
Was this the work of a soul shifter?

06:52.662 --> 06:53.579
[man 2] What's that?

07:02.630 --> 07:05.216
[dramatic music playing]

07:17.562 --> 07:20.189
Is that… Is it a soul shifter?
Are we gonna die?

07:21.274 --> 07:22.150
Stay… stay back!

07:22.859 --> 07:24.944
- [man 2] Oh, damn, you get back!
- [man 1] Begone, demon!

07:25.027 --> 07:27.113
- Begone!
- Go now! Get away!

07:27.613 --> 07:28.865
Hold on!

07:30.533 --> 07:31.951
- He's not a soul shifter.
- He's not!

07:33.828 --> 07:34.662
What's that?

07:36.289 --> 07:37.165
Are they charms?

07:37.248 --> 07:39.167
They said they'd ward off soul shifters?

07:40.668 --> 07:42.086
Where'd you get them? Gaema Village?

07:43.463 --> 07:44.297
Uh-huh.

07:44.380 --> 07:46.716
- Hmm, how much did it cost?
- A silver nyang.

07:46.799 --> 07:48.426
- For all three?
- No, my lord.

07:48.509 --> 07:50.052
Three for all, one for each.

07:51.345 --> 07:52.638
Well, my lord.

07:53.556 --> 07:54.515
That's expensive.

07:55.683 --> 07:57.185
Gaema Village has no morals.

07:58.102 --> 07:59.937
I've heard other places sold
ten for one nyang.

08:00.021 --> 08:01.647
Really? Where though?

08:01.731 --> 08:03.608
- [groans]
- Is that important right now, huh?

08:03.691 --> 08:04.942
Damn it!

08:05.026 --> 08:07.653
You should get your money's worth
since you've paid so much.

08:07.737 --> 08:09.739
[tense music]

08:13.075 --> 08:14.994
[breathes heavily]

08:23.002 --> 08:24.086
If you want to live,

08:24.962 --> 08:26.506
you'd better get down right now.

08:30.426 --> 08:31.469
[men groan]

08:42.563 --> 08:43.898
[grunts]

09:00.039 --> 09:01.123
[whimpers]

09:23.604 --> 09:24.855
[tense music halts]

09:25.982 --> 09:27.024
[grunts]

09:27.525 --> 09:28.901
[tense music resumes]

09:28.985 --> 09:29.860
[shouts]

09:48.087 --> 09:49.088
[groans]

09:52.883 --> 09:54.760
[tense music intensifies]

10:00.891 --> 10:02.018
[grunts]

10:05.146 --> 10:07.315
[scoffs]
You have the ice stone,

10:07.398 --> 10:10.276
yet your Tansu can
only make a single drop?

10:11.277 --> 10:15.656
Since your soul returned to a dead body,
you, too, are a soul shifter.

10:16.824 --> 10:19.619
To everyone, we are both monsters.

10:21.662 --> 10:22.663
Are you finished yet?

10:24.540 --> 10:26.876
If not, hurry up because that one drop…

10:28.252 --> 10:29.378
is going to be very painful.

10:33.174 --> 10:34.383
[screams]

10:44.018 --> 10:45.436
[screams]

10:48.272 --> 10:51.317
How dare you lecture me when you stole
you son's body to live a little longer?

10:52.068 --> 10:53.110
[grunts]

10:54.111 --> 10:56.197
[groans]

11:06.666 --> 11:07.875
[sighs]

11:18.302 --> 11:19.136
[all exclaim]

11:20.054 --> 11:23.933
So you're not a soul shifter,
but rather a mage who kills soul shifters.

11:24.016 --> 11:25.059
[laughs]

11:25.559 --> 11:28.270
Thank you very much
for saving our lives, my lord.

11:29.271 --> 11:31.273
- Is that liquor hanging from your waist?
- Yeah.

11:31.357 --> 11:32.191
Hmm.

11:35.653 --> 11:36.487
Here.

11:44.036 --> 11:47.581
My goodness…
to have his body stolen by his father.

11:48.416 --> 11:49.417
That poor boy!

11:49.500 --> 11:52.503
So it's true soul shifters turn to stone
when they die.

11:54.422 --> 11:57.174
Ah, my lord,
then Naksu must have been petrified too?

11:58.217 --> 12:00.386
I was right! She was petrified.

12:01.345 --> 12:04.807
See, these charms really are made
from the powder of her petrified body!

12:07.184 --> 12:10.646
They say that this charm has the power
to ward off even monsters like her.

12:11.230 --> 12:12.231
[man 2] Um, here, my lord.

12:12.815 --> 12:14.150
Would you like one?

12:17.653 --> 12:19.405
[pensive music playing]

12:29.373 --> 12:30.207
With this charm…

12:32.042 --> 12:33.502
even Naksu could be warded off?

12:37.465 --> 12:38.507
Do people really think…

12:39.967 --> 12:41.469
that it's even possible Naksu's alive?

12:42.344 --> 12:44.472
[sighs]
Naksu's dead, of course.

12:45.097 --> 12:47.266
Even though her body is
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho,

12:47.766 --> 12:50.895
the people around here,
there's many that still fear her.

13:01.489 --> 13:04.283
Well, pretty soon, men from Songrim
will come to clean up here.

13:08.579 --> 13:10.039
Uh, my lord, tell us your name.

13:13.417 --> 13:15.085
I think I know who that mage is.

13:16.462 --> 13:18.088
He's known as the mage that had…

13:18.797 --> 13:20.549
managed to master Hwansu with…

13:22.259 --> 13:23.344
help from the ice stone.

13:23.427 --> 13:25.262
[man 2] The one that Naksu almost killed?

13:26.722 --> 13:28.390
The master of the Jang family?

13:28.474 --> 13:32.353
But… what does he
have to do with that soul shifter, Naksu?

13:36.565 --> 13:38.567
["Blue Flower" by LIA playing]

13:44.657 --> 13:47.076
[young man] This charm will
even ward off someone like Naksu.

13:49.036 --> 13:49.912
If I keep this,

13:52.248 --> 13:53.958
I couldn't see you
even if you ever returned.

14:39.837 --> 14:44.550
[man 1] Naksu was his servant,
but also the love of his life

14:45.050 --> 14:46.385
who he intended to marry.

14:47.720 --> 14:50.055
And to return his affection for her,

14:51.807 --> 14:55.269
Naksu draw a sword
right through his chest.

14:55.936 --> 14:57.938
["Blue Flower" continues playing]

15:01.567 --> 15:02.484
[sighs]

15:43.150 --> 15:47.613
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

15:51.992 --> 15:53.535
[Jang Uk] The energy of the sky

15:53.619 --> 15:55.913
which reigns over the wind,
the rain, the clouds

15:55.996 --> 16:00.084
touched the land and created
a massive surge of energy,

16:00.167 --> 16:03.462
and with Lake Gyeongcheondaeho
keeping it contained at its center,

16:03.545 --> 16:04.880
a country was built.

16:05.756 --> 16:07.216
Because of the country's great lake,

16:08.258 --> 16:09.635
the nation was named Daeho.

16:10.803 --> 16:14.098
This tale is the story
about the mages of Daeho,

16:14.765 --> 16:17.351
a place that cannot be found
in history or with a map.

16:27.069 --> 16:29.029
[indistinct chatter]

16:29.113 --> 16:30.239
[laughter]

16:32.157 --> 16:34.284
- [vendor] Enjoy.
- [woman] Say thank you, honey.

16:43.836 --> 16:45.754
[crowd screaming]

16:54.179 --> 16:56.390
[suspenseful music playing]

17:05.858 --> 17:07.901
[crowd cheering, applauding]

17:10.279 --> 17:11.822
That must be another soul shifter.

17:12.322 --> 17:13.532
I'm so scared.

17:25.961 --> 17:26.879
Did you lose her?

17:27.504 --> 17:30.758
She fled into… Jinyowon just a moment ago.

17:35.012 --> 17:35.846
Jinyowon?

17:41.101 --> 17:42.561
JINYOWON

17:42.644 --> 17:45.731
[female mage] Outsiders are forbidden
from stepping foot into Jinyowon.

17:45.814 --> 17:48.692
Jinyowon, for the past three years,
has kept its door barred,

17:48.776 --> 17:50.944
forbidding any outsiders
from entering, I get it.

17:51.028 --> 17:53.697
However, a soul shifter ran inside
and it's urgent.

17:54.490 --> 17:56.158
Tell Lady Jin
I want to speak directly with her.

17:56.241 --> 17:58.660
Lady Jin has no interest
in meeting with you.

17:58.744 --> 18:00.412
This man is the leader of Songrim.

18:00.496 --> 18:02.998
How dare a lowly
and ordinary priestess like yourself

18:03.082 --> 18:05.459
refuse to relay his lord's dire message?

18:05.542 --> 18:07.628
- My apologies.
- Open the gate right now!

18:12.800 --> 18:14.802
[somber music playing]

18:40.911 --> 18:42.037
Young Lady Cho-yeon.

18:44.331 --> 18:46.291
[stammers]
It's been three years already.

18:47.334 --> 18:49.086
How have you been
holding up all this time?

18:49.169 --> 18:51.338
I did not come out here
to exchange pleasantries.

18:52.089 --> 18:55.551
My mother maintains
that she won't let outsiders in.

18:57.678 --> 18:58.762
So please, just go now.

18:59.555 --> 19:01.014
But the situation's dire.

19:01.598 --> 19:04.184
This soul shifter has already
harmed dozens at Yeongpo Dock.

19:04.268 --> 19:06.145
The people of Jinyowon might
get hurt as well.

19:06.228 --> 19:07.646
Like my father did?

19:10.065 --> 19:13.068
You couldn't even save
the father of your betrothed.

19:14.486 --> 19:16.280
How could you save anyone?

19:20.534 --> 19:21.535
Afterwards…

19:24.413 --> 19:26.748
you never gave me
the chance to say how sorry I was.

19:27.875 --> 19:29.418
It… It's always weighed on my heart.

19:29.501 --> 19:30.711
May that continue.

19:32.129 --> 19:33.630
I hope that you'll never forget.

19:34.798 --> 19:36.216
Y-Young Lady Jin--

19:36.300 --> 19:37.509
Please just go now.

19:45.017 --> 19:46.226
[sighs]

20:00.324 --> 20:01.658
[exhales deeply]

20:02.659 --> 20:04.578
[dramatic music playing]

20:16.632 --> 20:17.758
[gasps]

20:20.427 --> 20:21.261
Dang-gu…

20:22.596 --> 20:24.306
did someone just enter?

20:26.099 --> 20:27.351
Oh, yes.

20:28.602 --> 20:30.187
I believe that was Jang Uk, actually.

20:31.980 --> 20:34.358
He was out here chasing
that soul shifter with us.

20:35.234 --> 20:36.276
Jang Uk is here?

20:37.778 --> 20:39.988
You mean that he just let himself in?

20:40.781 --> 20:41.615
Because Uk's…

20:42.366 --> 20:44.993
on the order of the royal family
and the Unanimous Assembly.

20:45.077 --> 20:46.286
[breathes nervously]

20:47.287 --> 20:48.497
I'm closing the gate.

20:50.415 --> 20:51.250
Please just go.

20:57.923 --> 20:59.883
[gate squeaks]

21:01.635 --> 21:04.012
[mellow music playing]

21:05.305 --> 21:07.099
He will undoubtedly
catch the soul shifter,

21:07.182 --> 21:08.392
now that he's managed to get inside.

21:08.475 --> 21:10.227
I believe we can just wait
for him out here, my lord.

21:12.062 --> 21:12.896
Fine.

21:22.906 --> 21:25.701
You're telling me
Jang Uk has entered Jinyowon?

21:25.784 --> 21:26.618
Right.

21:27.202 --> 21:29.413
He's chasing a soul shifter
that's hiding here.

21:30.122 --> 21:33.041
And Bu-yeon, is she still
in the annex like she was told?

21:33.125 --> 21:35.043
The room that Bu-yeon is confined in

21:35.877 --> 21:37.921
is hidden by a barrier,
so it won't be seen.

21:39.172 --> 21:41.675
I promise he'll never find her.

21:43.969 --> 21:45.971
[suspenseful music playing]

21:52.519 --> 21:53.395
[distant cough]

21:54.688 --> 21:55.605
[coughs]

21:57.190 --> 21:59.192
[suspenseful music playing]

22:08.660 --> 22:09.494
[choking]

22:14.958 --> 22:17.210
[scream]

22:21.757 --> 22:22.632
[sighs softly]

22:33.268 --> 22:34.853
Looks like you shifted a while ago.

22:38.732 --> 22:40.734
[ominous music playing]

22:44.654 --> 22:45.489
What's this?

23:04.299 --> 23:06.635
[ominous music continues playing]

23:26.822 --> 23:27.823
What is this place?

23:29.950 --> 23:30.784
A prison?

24:01.731 --> 24:02.774
[Bu-yeon] Don't touch that.

24:09.281 --> 24:11.533
Who are you? How'd you get in here?

24:14.953 --> 24:15.787
[exhales deeply]

24:24.379 --> 24:25.213
Are you crazy?

24:25.297 --> 24:27.340
You look like
every other lousy Jinyowon priestess.

24:27.424 --> 24:28.842
How dare you point a poker at me?

24:31.094 --> 24:32.304
That's incredible.

24:34.181 --> 24:36.933
Did you get in here
by breaking through the barrier outside?

24:37.017 --> 24:39.227
Any Jinyowon priestess would
recognize who I am.

24:40.061 --> 24:41.146
Who are you?

24:41.730 --> 24:43.064
What is this place?

24:44.065 --> 24:45.066
Is this a prison?

24:45.692 --> 24:47.694
You're… locked in here?

24:49.279 --> 24:50.739
It's not a prison.

24:52.908 --> 24:54.075
[Bu-yeon exhales]

24:55.994 --> 24:57.495
I can probably use this to get out.

24:58.413 --> 25:00.415
[quirky music playing]

25:02.751 --> 25:04.711
Throw this as well, go on now.

25:05.462 --> 25:06.296
What?

25:07.756 --> 25:09.007
Is it too flat to work?

25:10.717 --> 25:11.718
Then…

25:15.222 --> 25:16.598
[objects clanking]

25:18.099 --> 25:20.185
Is this one better? Uh…

25:24.231 --> 25:25.690
This one, or maybe this one?

25:29.736 --> 25:31.238
So you really are locked up in here.

25:31.321 --> 25:32.364
Don't know…

25:33.615 --> 25:34.950
You must be really ill.

25:35.951 --> 25:37.077
[Bu-yeon] Could this work?

25:37.744 --> 25:38.662
Wait, you're leaving?

25:39.329 --> 25:41.831
Fine then, take me too, all right?

25:49.714 --> 25:50.715
Are you…

25:51.716 --> 25:52.926
going to try and follow me out?

25:53.635 --> 25:55.387
It's been forever since I was out.

25:56.471 --> 25:58.431
[sniffs]

26:01.351 --> 26:02.894
I can smell flowers on your clothes.

26:03.603 --> 26:05.272
The roses must be in bloom then, right?

26:07.274 --> 26:08.108
Look here.

26:08.900 --> 26:11.486
I understand that you're truly
dying to get out of this place,

26:12.737 --> 26:13.780
but I can't help you.

26:13.863 --> 26:16.408
But that probably can, use that instead.

26:16.491 --> 26:18.493
No, not that, too exhausting.

26:18.576 --> 26:20.745
- Take me with!
- Look, you lousy priestess.

26:22.580 --> 26:25.667
Unless you want to end up like the poker
in the wall, get off of me immediately.

26:28.253 --> 26:29.379
I'm not used to people…

26:30.630 --> 26:32.132
standing this close to me anymore.

26:46.646 --> 26:47.939
That's a pretty stone you have.

26:51.651 --> 26:52.485
So…

26:53.486 --> 26:55.030
you have the sky's energy, don't you?

26:57.240 --> 26:59.034
I guess you're not as lousy as I thought.

26:59.117 --> 26:59.951
You…

27:00.702 --> 27:02.120
can see what's inside me?

27:03.038 --> 27:03.872
Yeah.

27:04.497 --> 27:06.207
I have the ability to see all the energy.

27:07.208 --> 27:09.627
I heard some rumors about
a priestess who can see energy.

27:10.462 --> 27:11.463
Are you saying that's you?

27:13.048 --> 27:15.383
Then who are you, huh?

27:16.259 --> 27:18.887
There's a good reason why
I can't reveal who I am just yet.

27:20.180 --> 27:21.431
But once you find out,

27:21.514 --> 27:24.601
I can promise you that you'll definitely
want to help me out of here.

27:31.232 --> 27:32.067
Jang Uk?

27:32.150 --> 27:34.486
There are signs of his fight
with the soul shifter everywhere.

27:34.569 --> 27:35.904
Even where Bu-yeon is hiding?

27:35.987 --> 27:38.698
I don't know. I couldn't search it
because of the barrier.

27:38.782 --> 27:41.534
[sighs]
Oh, dear! That area is vulnerable.

27:41.618 --> 27:44.579
We can't let Jang Uk see her,
no matter what.

27:49.376 --> 27:52.170
Seeing as how they went
as far as surrounding you with a barrier,

27:52.253 --> 27:54.005
I suppose they didn't put you
in here because you're crazy.

27:54.089 --> 27:57.175
If you get me out,
I'll actually tell you who I really am.

27:57.759 --> 27:59.260
You'll be shocked when you know.

28:02.097 --> 28:04.182
- No deal.
- You're not curious about who I am?

28:04.265 --> 28:06.976
At the moment, Jinyowon and I are not
on the best of terms with each other.

28:07.060 --> 28:10.271
Letting you out could possibly worsen
my relationship with them even further.

28:10.980 --> 28:13.191
You and Jinyowon have bad blood?

28:15.985 --> 28:16.903
[Jang Uk sighs]

28:23.201 --> 28:24.869
This here was your escape, right?

28:27.080 --> 28:28.373
[scoffs]
Not very good.

28:28.456 --> 28:30.166
Hey, that took me
three whole days to make!

28:33.336 --> 28:34.170
Three days, huh?

28:38.049 --> 28:39.634
[gasps]
Hey!

28:40.969 --> 28:41.803
[angry scoff]

28:44.597 --> 28:45.890
You could have left without me.

28:45.974 --> 28:47.392
Why did you have to do that?

28:47.475 --> 28:49.978
Because they will suspect me
if you escape right after I left.

28:50.061 --> 28:51.730
I don't want any misunderstandings.

28:52.564 --> 28:54.774
This took you three days,
then postpone your escape

28:54.858 --> 28:56.609
by three more days
so I'm not linked to it.

29:02.532 --> 29:04.409
I just wanted to leave for a little while.

29:05.618 --> 29:08.538
Even if I did get out, I…

29:09.998 --> 29:11.374
would have to return anyway.

29:19.591 --> 29:21.843
So why's a priestess like you
locked up in here in the first place?

29:23.219 --> 29:24.262
What are you guilty of?

29:26.097 --> 29:27.140
The crime of living.

29:28.641 --> 29:30.101
I'm guilty of being born.

29:32.103 --> 29:33.646
The crime that has locked me up

29:34.647 --> 29:36.608
is my existence in this world at all.

29:39.652 --> 29:41.529
I had died a very long time ago.

29:47.535 --> 29:48.578
This must have been Jang Uk.

29:49.788 --> 29:52.624
He must have fought
all the way to the annex's entrance.

30:01.174 --> 30:03.176
[solemn music playing]

30:05.804 --> 30:06.679
[door opens]

30:09.015 --> 30:09.849
[Cho-yeon] Bu-yeon.

30:14.062 --> 30:14.896
Bu-yeon.

30:15.522 --> 30:17.482
Did you see anyone come in?

30:17.565 --> 30:18.650
No.

30:19.734 --> 30:22.153
Who else would have come in here
other than Mother and you?

30:27.325 --> 30:28.159
Why?

30:29.035 --> 30:30.119
Did something happen?

30:31.412 --> 30:33.081
A soul shifter snuck in here.

30:34.165 --> 30:36.209
And a mage entered when he chased her

30:36.918 --> 30:38.294
causing a commotion.

30:38.378 --> 30:39.504
Soul shifter?

30:40.547 --> 30:42.799
A monster whose soul
doesn't belong to its body?

30:44.175 --> 30:45.009
Uh.

30:46.094 --> 30:48.429
But we killed it, so don't worry.

30:57.564 --> 30:58.857
[door closes]

31:02.485 --> 31:05.905
[Bu-yeon] So he was a mage
who came to kill a soul shifter.

31:09.325 --> 31:11.619
[quirky music playing]

31:12.620 --> 31:15.248
[Jang Uk] This will be more than enough
for you to make your escape.

31:16.165 --> 31:17.125
[chuckles]

31:19.252 --> 31:20.587
Let me be very clear.

31:20.670 --> 31:23.631
They can't know I was here,
so wait a while after I go.

31:24.716 --> 31:25.800
Sure!

31:28.136 --> 31:29.387
Go put up two more.

31:30.054 --> 31:32.724
I'm not nearly… as tall as you.

31:32.807 --> 31:33.933
Will two more be enough?

31:34.767 --> 31:36.686
- You are really short.
- So three more then!

31:38.479 --> 31:39.564
Thanks.

31:40.773 --> 31:41.733
[Jang Uk scoffs]

31:43.735 --> 31:46.738
Oh, and why did you decide to help me?

31:47.447 --> 31:48.907
What's with the change of heart, huh?

31:50.033 --> 31:51.534
Because we're guilty of the same crime.

31:54.037 --> 31:55.580
The crime of being here, existing…

31:56.956 --> 31:57.874
when I should not be.

32:01.044 --> 32:03.046
[somber music playing]

32:12.513 --> 32:14.349
Someone guilty of the same crime…

32:20.897 --> 32:22.899
[somber music continues playing]

32:33.701 --> 32:35.912
The roses outside must have
really bloomed now.

32:41.626 --> 32:43.628
[uplifting music playing]

32:56.933 --> 32:59.310
SONGRIM

33:02.438 --> 33:05.441
This soul shifter got on
a cargo ship at Yeongpo Dock

33:05.525 --> 33:07.151
and slaughtered everyone onboard the ship.

33:07.694 --> 33:10.822
Soul shifters that have run wild
are showing up everywhere.

33:11.322 --> 33:12.156
Hmm.

33:12.240 --> 33:14.659
Uk's been the one who's been killing them.

33:14.742 --> 33:19.455
That's only because we all agreed
that's how we use him since he was reborn…

33:19.539 --> 33:20.456
[chuckles]

33:20.540 --> 33:22.417
…with the power
of the ice stone within him.

33:22.500 --> 33:23.584
Because you "agreed"?

33:24.752 --> 33:26.462
Uk's just doing what you told him to.

33:27.672 --> 33:28.506
Are you…

33:30.049 --> 33:32.260
still feeling awkward
when you're around Jang Uk?

33:33.594 --> 33:36.305
Since Yul has returned
to live in Seoho Fortress.

33:36.389 --> 33:38.307
You're the only friend he has.

33:38.391 --> 33:41.310
If you distance yourself,
what does he have left?

33:42.895 --> 33:44.397
I'm not trying to be distant.

33:45.064 --> 33:45.898
It's just…

33:47.650 --> 33:49.569
I don't know how to act around him.

33:51.446 --> 33:54.657
It's not like I can say
I'm envious of the power he holds.

33:56.159 --> 33:58.077
But I can't try to comfort him,

33:59.412 --> 34:00.538
and say it's okay to give up.

34:02.665 --> 34:04.375
Nothing's like how it used to be.

34:04.459 --> 34:06.461
Well, since he used the ice stone,

34:07.253 --> 34:09.338
to vanquish the soul shifter,

34:09.964 --> 34:13.259
I assume he'll have trouble
sleeping tonight as well.

34:13.342 --> 34:14.844
Oh, dear me.

34:23.186 --> 34:24.896
We received words from Songrim.

34:25.772 --> 34:28.316
Are you doing all right?

34:29.650 --> 34:31.110
When am I ever not all right?

34:32.028 --> 34:34.530
Worrying about me all the time
is gonna kill you, Maidservant Kim.

34:35.031 --> 34:36.324
So don't worry about me.

34:40.870 --> 34:42.371
If you had to use that sword,

34:43.331 --> 34:44.916
I suppose that you'll struggle tonight.

34:44.999 --> 34:46.626
I'm pretty used to it now.

34:47.710 --> 34:48.920
It happens to me every time.

34:56.969 --> 34:57.845
[sighs]

34:58.554 --> 34:59.806
Did you heat up his room today?

35:00.848 --> 35:03.476
Prepare a strong drink,
and make sure he has a brazier.

35:05.019 --> 35:07.146
I'm too scared
to enter his room on my own.

35:08.147 --> 35:10.441
Going near the Young Master's room
gives me goosebumps all over.

35:10.525 --> 35:12.693
- Sends chills down my spine.
- Goodness.

35:13.194 --> 35:15.822
Just light it, okay? I'll carry it inside.

35:15.905 --> 35:16.739
Yes.

35:17.365 --> 35:18.449
[tuts]

35:21.828 --> 35:22.787
[sighs]

35:28.918 --> 35:30.503
[wind blowing]

35:34.173 --> 35:36.008
[tense music intensifies]

35:38.803 --> 35:40.555
[howling]

35:41.097 --> 35:43.474
[shrieking, whispering]

35:44.183 --> 35:47.103
- [ghost 1] Save me!
- [ghost 2] Help! Please help me!

35:47.937 --> 35:51.274
[ghost 3 laughs]
I don't want to die.

35:52.191 --> 35:53.693
[ghost 4] I want the ice stone!

36:00.408 --> 36:03.244
[Heo Yeom] Since he is a human
using the energy of the sky,

36:03.327 --> 36:06.581
wraiths would surround him
to feed on that power.

36:07.123 --> 36:11.169
They are deafening, cold,
unsightly, and pitiful.

36:11.961 --> 36:14.839
That's the price one pays
for taking the ice stone

36:14.922 --> 36:17.216
and using the energy of the sky.

36:18.885 --> 36:20.887
[indistinct chatter]

36:34.275 --> 36:36.652
Yeongpo Dock lost many workers
to the soul shifter,

36:36.736 --> 36:38.112
it will be closed for a while.

36:38.196 --> 36:40.865
We need to deliver these goods
to Wol Fortress by land.

36:41.574 --> 36:43.326
The road to Daegangtongun will be fastest.

36:43.409 --> 36:44.368
[man] Yes, my lord.

36:46.954 --> 36:48.164
[breathes deeply]

36:49.123 --> 36:53.920
Young Master Park is really starting to
look like the leader of Songrim now.

36:54.003 --> 36:56.339
He hasn't shown much promise
when it comes to spells casting,

36:56.422 --> 37:00.009
but as a businessman, he has been…
exceptionally outstanding.

37:03.596 --> 37:05.223
- [Sun-I] Young Lady Heo.
- [Yun-ok] Hmm?

37:08.184 --> 37:10.269
[light music playing]

37:18.194 --> 37:21.656
Has Young Lady Heo decided not
to return to Wol Fortress after all?

37:21.739 --> 37:25.576
She's been in charge of tending
to the new body of the Queen now.

37:26.244 --> 37:27.078
So she can't leave.

37:27.161 --> 37:30.206
But you said she visited
your home a few days ago?

37:30.915 --> 37:31.874
[Maid Kim] Yes, my lord.

37:32.583 --> 37:35.211
She said she was worried
about our young master's insomnia,

37:35.795 --> 37:38.464
so she insisted of
bringing the medicine herself.

37:38.547 --> 37:43.052
So then has he… has he ever thanked her,
like, asked her to get tea with him?

37:45.096 --> 37:48.182
I understand her,
so I've tried my best to help.

37:48.975 --> 37:50.059
But it's not easy with him.

37:50.142 --> 37:51.227
[sighs]

37:52.061 --> 37:55.231
I keep saying
she should give up on him already,

37:55.314 --> 37:56.857
but she won't listen.

37:56.941 --> 37:58.484
[Maid Kim] I'll keep trying.

37:58.567 --> 38:02.071
[sighs]
So you're going to visit Jin, yeah?

38:02.154 --> 38:03.531
- Right.
- If you go,

38:03.614 --> 38:06.534
you know that…
that silly new hobby of his, this one.

38:07.201 --> 38:08.953
Could you try to persuade him to quit?

38:09.829 --> 38:10.830
It's all thanks to him

38:10.913 --> 38:13.666
that almost every person
in Songrim have pickled tongues.

38:14.250 --> 38:16.794
- They all have pickled tongues?
- Our tongues are a mess.

38:16.877 --> 38:18.879
What could he do to make people suffer?

38:18.963 --> 38:19.797
[sighs]

38:21.465 --> 38:23.175
[uplifting music playing]

38:25.094 --> 38:26.345
[knife chopping]

38:44.155 --> 38:45.156
[groans]

39:08.596 --> 39:09.680
Hello, my lord.

39:10.723 --> 39:13.225
- What are you up to?
- It's nice to see you.

39:13.851 --> 39:15.936
Today, I'm making kkakdugi,
Maidservant Kim.

39:16.020 --> 39:18.230
Are you really using all of this?

39:18.314 --> 39:21.442
You should see how delighted
everyone looks whenever I bring

39:21.525 --> 39:24.028
a new batch of kimchi
I made into the kitchen.

39:24.111 --> 39:24.987
Yeah.

39:25.696 --> 39:27.823
I heard you gave them five massive pots

39:27.907 --> 39:30.284
of mustard leaf
and green onion kimchi last time.

39:30.368 --> 39:32.286
Well, there's really not that much to it.

39:32.370 --> 39:34.330
I really only do it
to help the time go by.

39:35.498 --> 39:38.584
That said everyone's so eager
for my kimchi now.

39:38.667 --> 39:39.502
[chuckles]

39:39.585 --> 39:42.088
I don't think
they are that desperate for kimchi.

39:43.005 --> 39:44.882
You don't need to make this much.

39:44.965 --> 39:48.260
I know they can't just ask me for more
since I can be pretty intimidating.

39:49.595 --> 39:51.138
Even I say that, you know.

39:51.222 --> 39:52.973
- [chuckles awkwardly]
- I ought to make more.

39:53.057 --> 39:54.892
I need to get way more garlic then.

39:55.684 --> 39:56.685
I'll be back soon.

40:01.649 --> 40:03.484
Everyone's begging me to stop him.

40:13.953 --> 40:15.871
[retches, coughs]

40:18.165 --> 40:19.834
[exclaims]

40:20.418 --> 40:23.129
I can now see why
Maidservant Park was going insane.

40:23.212 --> 40:25.464
Ugh! If he makes a lot of this here,

40:26.298 --> 40:29.009
we will never get rid of it.
Eating this is practically torture!

40:29.969 --> 40:31.137
[sighs]

40:32.304 --> 40:33.139
[nervous chuckle]

40:37.476 --> 40:38.310
Oh, yes.

40:39.103 --> 40:42.690
Uh, my lord, I could
really use some radish now.

40:42.773 --> 40:44.567
Could I please take
some of those there with me?

40:44.650 --> 40:45.568
Of course.

40:45.651 --> 40:48.320
But then, I won't have enough
for kkakdugi.

40:48.404 --> 40:50.448
Oh, I think this is a lot.

40:51.198 --> 40:53.075
Too much of anything is never good.

40:53.993 --> 40:55.077
Yes, that is very true.

40:55.161 --> 40:56.620
[both chuckle]

40:56.704 --> 40:58.622
- Please sit down.
- Sure.

41:06.797 --> 41:10.718
Do you feel like there's a hole in you
ever since you stepped down?

41:12.178 --> 41:14.597
I tend my land now, care for the flowers

41:14.680 --> 41:16.140
and do my own housework.

41:16.223 --> 41:17.308
I like it for what it is.

41:19.268 --> 41:20.102
Right.

41:25.858 --> 41:27.151
[birds chirping]

41:27.234 --> 41:28.903
[light music playing]

41:29.987 --> 41:33.282
You've planted so many balsam seeds.

41:37.661 --> 41:41.081
My Young Master
still seems to be recovering.

41:44.752 --> 41:45.878
I'm afraid…

41:46.962 --> 41:49.131
I'll have to stay by his side this year.

41:51.842 --> 41:52.760
Yes, I know.

41:53.552 --> 41:55.179
Three years ago when everything happened,

41:55.971 --> 41:58.766
you take it upon yourself
to step down and take the blame.

42:00.643 --> 42:03.103
I should have discouraged you.
But instead, I…

42:04.021 --> 42:05.105
brazenly thanked you for it,

42:07.066 --> 42:10.152
because I was relieved
they spared my young master.

42:11.737 --> 42:12.863
All thanks to you!

42:15.950 --> 42:18.869
We haven't even started peeling
the garlic and yet you're crying now.

42:21.914 --> 42:24.291
- We have all of these yet to peel.
- [laughs]

42:25.459 --> 42:26.293
Yeah.

42:26.877 --> 42:28.921
I'll peel all the garlic for you, my lord.

42:29.004 --> 42:30.673
[both laugh]

42:30.756 --> 42:33.300
But it'll be too bitter
if you put all this in there.

42:33.384 --> 42:35.594
Everything tastes better
the more you put in, you know.

42:38.931 --> 42:42.351
I forgot I need some garlic,
so please let me take at least half.

42:44.311 --> 42:46.063
Will it be as tasty then?

42:46.146 --> 42:48.691
Half of that is more than plenty.
[chuckles]

42:52.528 --> 42:54.738
What do you mean
Jinyowon's preparing for a wedding?

42:54.822 --> 42:57.366
Do you remember how we placed
all of those gifts into storage?

42:57.449 --> 42:59.660
Everything we're supposed
to use for your wedding to Lady Jin.

43:00.703 --> 43:03.455
Today, they requested for us
to send all of them over to Jinyowon.

43:04.623 --> 43:05.916
[mutters]

43:06.542 --> 43:10.004
I believe someone's getting married.

43:10.087 --> 43:12.881
But the only one in the Jin family

43:13.591 --> 43:15.342
who could get married
is Young Lady Cho-yeon.

43:18.971 --> 43:19.847
[sighs]

43:26.270 --> 43:28.147
The wedding date has already been set?

43:28.897 --> 43:30.524
Mother, that feels a bit rushed.

43:31.817 --> 43:33.444
[Ho-gyeong] The suitor wasn't easy
to find.

43:33.527 --> 43:35.738
My decision will be final.

43:37.823 --> 43:38.741
How could…

43:39.825 --> 43:41.201
That's cruel, Mother!

43:43.996 --> 43:45.205
She actually…

43:46.707 --> 43:48.042
not my real sister,

43:49.543 --> 43:51.503
- but that other woman?
- Jin Cho-yeon.

43:55.174 --> 43:56.008
She is Bu-yeon.

43:57.051 --> 43:58.469
That woman's soul was gone

43:58.552 --> 44:01.472
by the time we retrieved Bu-yeon's body
from the lake three years ago.

44:02.139 --> 44:05.643
That body belongs to my daughter, Bu-yeon.

44:13.192 --> 44:15.194
[pensive music playing]

44:19.740 --> 44:20.699
[door opens]

44:26.664 --> 44:27.790
Bu-yeon, dear.

44:30.751 --> 44:32.211
Yes, Mother.

44:35.589 --> 44:38.133
I am going to get married soon?

44:39.718 --> 44:42.888
If I marry, does it mean that
I can leave this room then?

44:42.971 --> 44:44.264
He'll come and live with you here.

44:44.348 --> 44:46.266
When he arrives on your wedding day,

44:46.350 --> 44:51.105
you will continue living in this room,
just as you always have been.

44:52.648 --> 44:56.735
If I'm still going to remain locked up,
then why do I have to get married now?

44:56.819 --> 44:59.738
Because we need an heir
who will lead Jinyowon.

45:00.406 --> 45:03.325
The children that yield
the greatest divine powers have…

45:04.326 --> 45:05.953
always come from the eldest daughters.

45:07.871 --> 45:11.041
Please gift us all
a daughter with your powers.

45:14.044 --> 45:17.840
You're saying I'm forced
to be here so I can give birth to a child?

45:20.843 --> 45:21.885
No, I don't want to.

45:22.553 --> 45:24.054
That's not the marriage I want to have.

45:24.638 --> 45:26.265
It has already been decided.

45:26.348 --> 45:27.766
Just do what you're told.

45:30.352 --> 45:32.646
But if I get married
like you want me to, Mother,

45:33.772 --> 45:36.066
that means I have to
live my life inside this room.

45:38.610 --> 45:39.445
Bu-yeon, dear.

45:40.195 --> 45:42.823
After I lost you, it took years
for me to find you again.

45:44.992 --> 45:49.830
Get married to the man that I have chosen,
then you can stay by my side forever.

45:53.125 --> 45:53.959
Mother.

45:55.878 --> 45:57.463
Who is the man that Bu-yeon…

45:58.630 --> 45:59.465
is marrying?

45:59.548 --> 46:01.884
He comes from the Seo family
at Seoho Fortress.

46:01.967 --> 46:04.386
When he arrives, he'll stay at Chwiseonru.

46:04.470 --> 46:07.514
And then the wedding will take place
at his uncle's house.

46:08.724 --> 46:12.394
He's the suitor that's perfect
in every possible way.

46:19.359 --> 46:21.361
[somber music playing]

46:39.505 --> 46:40.380
[Yun-o exhales]

46:43.759 --> 46:45.636
It looks like we'll arrive at Daeho soon.

46:46.220 --> 46:47.554
You haven't been for three years?

46:47.638 --> 46:48.472
Yeah.

46:49.681 --> 46:52.935
I didn't know it'd be three years
before I'd be able to come back here.

46:53.894 --> 46:54.728
But Yul,

46:55.354 --> 46:59.691
why did Master Heo forbid you from
returning to Daeho for such a long time?

46:59.775 --> 47:01.652
You're not the kind
that gets into trouble.

47:02.236 --> 47:04.404
Did you have a problem
with someone in Songrim?

47:05.656 --> 47:06.949
Master Heo did it to protect me.

47:08.367 --> 47:11.161
Because I was a coward,
I just did as I was told.

47:14.373 --> 47:15.207
[Seo Yul sighs]

47:15.290 --> 47:17.417
The water level
of the lake's dropped considerably.

47:17.501 --> 47:19.002
I guess due to the three-year drought.

47:19.586 --> 47:20.587
Its energy is weaker too.

47:20.671 --> 47:23.507
There's even talk about
performing some rites for the lake.

47:24.299 --> 47:26.468
The Unanimous Assembly plans to meet.

47:26.552 --> 47:27.719
And if they perform that rite,

47:28.470 --> 47:31.932
the Jinyowon priestess will be
something they're all desperate for.

47:32.015 --> 47:33.809
[foreboding music playing]

47:38.564 --> 47:40.065
[Master Lee] Jang Uk of Songrim

47:40.148 --> 47:43.402
has defeated his 29th soul shifter
and have retrieved their soul.

47:43.485 --> 47:44.778
So then as usual,

47:46.071 --> 47:49.616
the Crown Prince shall personally
visit him to give him his reward.

47:51.618 --> 47:53.078
[Mu] Sire, from this moment on,

47:53.745 --> 47:56.498
Cheonbugwan will deliver them
instead of the prince.

47:56.582 --> 47:57.874
No, Sire.

47:57.958 --> 48:02.296
I must insist that the Crown Prince
go and reward Uk himself as always.

48:07.301 --> 48:08.135
[sighs]

48:08.635 --> 48:10.429
[tense music playing]

48:14.808 --> 48:16.810
Since every kill is 1,000 gold nyang,

48:17.436 --> 48:19.980
Jang Uk is well on his way to
becoming the wealthiest man in Daeho.

48:20.063 --> 48:23.025
If 1,000 gold nyang is
all it costs for the credit,

48:23.108 --> 48:24.526
then you should happily pay it.

48:25.110 --> 48:28.030
The people of Daeho believe that
you were the one who ordered Jang Uk

48:28.113 --> 48:30.073
to kill all of the monsters
that have run wild.

48:30.157 --> 48:33.493
They even praise you
for being the King's Star.

48:34.286 --> 48:35.704
- [sighs]
- All the while,

48:35.787 --> 48:38.040
they call him a monster
who catches other monsters.

48:38.123 --> 48:40.250
Everyone fears him and avoids him.

48:40.334 --> 48:41.960
That's something
that Jang Uk brought upon himself.

48:42.878 --> 48:45.964
Why does he insist on carrying
Naksu's sword when that's what killed him?

48:46.048 --> 48:48.091
Some say it's because
he bears a bitter grudge,

48:48.175 --> 48:51.219
while there are others who say
he's still painfully in love with her.

48:51.887 --> 48:52.804
[sighs]

48:54.640 --> 48:56.808
What are your thought on this,
Your Royal Highness?

48:56.892 --> 48:58.143
He's nothing but a lunatic.

48:58.226 --> 48:59.936
A dark and ominous figure

49:00.020 --> 49:02.272
who's chosen to wield her sword
and kill soul shifters,

49:02.356 --> 49:03.649
who are just like she was.

49:05.901 --> 49:08.737
That's exactly how people perceive him.
That's what he is now.

49:08.820 --> 49:11.448
Is that not how you intended it
to be, Your Royal Highness?

49:14.159 --> 49:16.578
[pensive music playing]

49:19.706 --> 49:21.792
He's living the life
you wanted him to have.

49:22.292 --> 49:23.210
Go to him, Sire.

49:23.794 --> 49:27.798
So you can personally praise and reward
that dark and ominous lunatic yourself.

49:28.799 --> 49:29.716
[sighs]

49:51.655 --> 49:53.615
[Go Won]
When I visit this empty Jeongjingak,

49:53.699 --> 49:55.325
my heart feels very heavy.

49:55.409 --> 49:58.745
Since Jang Uk is the last mage
that remains in these halls,

49:58.829 --> 50:01.206
the energy you feel in this place
is entirely his.

50:01.289 --> 50:03.792
They say wherever he goes,
it's always cold and dark.

50:04.876 --> 50:06.837
[footsteps approaching]

50:13.552 --> 50:16.179
I've come here to reward you
for the soul shifters you've killed.

50:17.013 --> 50:18.265
Thanks as always, Your Highness.

50:19.015 --> 50:20.142
You can just leave it and go.

50:25.814 --> 50:28.191
How dare he tell you to leave
instead of accepting it himself?

50:28.942 --> 50:30.318
Should I go and demand that he return?

50:30.402 --> 50:31.236
It's fine.

50:41.830 --> 50:44.666
I heard that you followed the soul shifter
all the way into Jinyowon.

50:45.751 --> 50:48.420
Haven't they forbidden outsiders
from entering? How'd you get in?

50:48.503 --> 50:50.422
Do you really think
there's anywhere I can't enter

50:50.505 --> 50:52.007
just because someone said no?

50:52.090 --> 50:54.593
I'm very used to feeling
not being welcomed.

50:57.679 --> 51:00.307
Is that why you drink alone
in this dark and gloomy place?

51:04.686 --> 51:06.772
Park Dang-gu used to be
pretty good friends with you.

51:06.855 --> 51:07.898
Now though…

51:08.732 --> 51:10.233
it might be a bit harder to laugh with him

51:10.317 --> 51:11.943
when you're the reason
his wedding fell through.

51:12.652 --> 51:14.946
Seo Yul ran off
to live in the Seoho Fortress.

51:15.030 --> 51:17.908
And apparently, all the mages
in Jeongjingak left because of you.

51:20.994 --> 51:22.704
You really are alone, aren't you?

51:30.420 --> 51:31.713
[sighs]

51:31.797 --> 51:34.466
I'm not going to sugarcoat my words
and try and protect your feelings, okay?

51:37.219 --> 51:38.136
[exclaims]

51:38.220 --> 51:40.722
Hey, why… why do you drink
such strong liquor?

51:40.806 --> 51:42.224
My insides feel like they're burning.

51:42.307 --> 51:44.142
Force it down. It's better if it's strong.

51:44.768 --> 51:47.813
Strong liquor is gonna be good against
the chill the wraiths emit.

51:47.896 --> 51:48.814
Wait! Wraiths?

51:51.525 --> 51:52.651
But this is Jeongjingak.

51:53.944 --> 51:54.945
Oh, you didn't hear?

51:55.028 --> 51:56.696
How those things follow me everywhere.

51:58.365 --> 52:00.367
[intriguing music playing]

52:01.910 --> 52:02.744
What?

52:03.411 --> 52:04.746
It's the middle of the day though.

52:07.082 --> 52:07.916
That's just absurd.

52:07.999 --> 52:10.377
You're welcome to leave
if you feel uncomfortable being here.

52:10.460 --> 52:12.462
I highly doubt you came here today
because you missed me.

52:12.546 --> 52:14.714
Then why do you every time
ask me to reward you in person

52:14.798 --> 52:16.466
if you know how uncomfortable
it makes me feel?

52:16.967 --> 52:18.218
I really doubt you need the money.

52:19.511 --> 52:20.762
It makes me feel at ease.

52:20.846 --> 52:22.389
My heart feels much lighter

52:22.472 --> 52:25.350
knowing that my power can only be used
for atoning sins and being rewarded.

52:25.433 --> 52:28.687
So all of the praises I've been receiving
from punishing and rewarding you

52:30.105 --> 52:31.648
must appear also trifling to you, right?

52:32.899 --> 52:33.733
[clicks tongue]

52:36.486 --> 52:37.988
This is what I hate about you, Jang Uk.

52:38.071 --> 52:41.116
The way you look down and mock
everything that I care about.

52:41.199 --> 52:42.409
I find it very offensive.

52:42.492 --> 52:44.369
Don't you think
you should be offended, Your Highness?

52:45.662 --> 52:47.539
That's why I'm doing this
without any question.

52:53.420 --> 52:55.213
You're afraid to dismiss me as arrogant.

52:55.797 --> 52:58.717
And yet you're too proud to admit
that I'm filled with spirit.

52:59.843 --> 53:01.428
I'm sure you can't stand that.

53:07.851 --> 53:08.810
[Go Won] You're right.

53:10.437 --> 53:12.981
You are just as annoying
as a splinter under my fingernail.

53:13.064 --> 53:14.858
A splinter under my fingernail, huh?

53:16.568 --> 53:17.819
How trifling.

53:20.655 --> 53:21.781
Did Jin Mu say…

53:22.866 --> 53:24.868
you should just dismiss me
so that you feel better?

53:25.869 --> 53:27.871
[intense music playing]

53:30.373 --> 53:31.541
Am I not too…

53:33.251 --> 53:34.794
powerful to be a splinter to you?

53:39.049 --> 53:41.259
I get you're frustrated
because you can't just rip me out,

53:41.343 --> 53:42.427
but you're not the victim here.

53:43.970 --> 53:45.513
I don't think that your splinter's more…

53:46.765 --> 53:47.599
painful than

53:48.642 --> 53:50.518
a sword being stabbed
straight through the chest.

53:52.020 --> 53:54.022
[suspenseful music playing]

53:59.277 --> 54:00.111
[exhales]

54:06.409 --> 54:09.287
Well, I'll see you after
the next soul shifter, Your Highness.

54:23.385 --> 54:24.427
[door opens]

54:25.804 --> 54:27.138
[Cho-yeon] What do you mean
she disappeared?

54:27.222 --> 54:28.765
- [female mage] Look over here, my lady.
- [Cho-yeon gasps]

54:29.975 --> 54:31.309
She must have used these to climb

54:31.393 --> 54:33.812
and then escaped
through the window up there.

54:34.896 --> 54:36.356
What are those doing there?

54:37.357 --> 54:39.150
How could Bu-yeon do this?

54:39.234 --> 54:40.068
I don't know.

54:41.486 --> 54:42.320
[sighs]

54:42.821 --> 54:45.407
We must find her before my mother does.

54:46.074 --> 54:47.784
We've tied a tracking thread on her wrist.

54:47.867 --> 54:50.328
It may take some time, but we'll find her.

54:53.748 --> 54:55.750
[foreboding music playing]

54:58.294 --> 55:00.296
[indistinct chatter]

55:07.220 --> 55:09.597
[By-yeon] The last time I got out,
it took them four hours to find me.

55:09.681 --> 55:11.433
I must find my betrothed before then.

55:12.100 --> 55:14.561
He comes from the Seo family
at Seoho Fortress.

55:15.270 --> 55:17.313
When he arrives, he'll stay
at Chwiseonru for a while.

55:17.397 --> 55:18.481
Chwiseonru.

55:22.694 --> 55:26.364
So you're looking for a man
arriving from Seoho Fortress, right?

55:26.448 --> 55:29.075
That's right.
I was told he would be staying here.

55:29.659 --> 55:31.578
Yes. We do have that name.

55:32.370 --> 55:35.373
But there are two here, so…

55:38.752 --> 55:40.378
I guess I'm looking for the one

55:40.462 --> 55:42.714
that could be a perfect suitor
in every possible way.

55:42.797 --> 55:44.758
[chuckles]
Ah.

55:44.841 --> 55:46.801
Then you are seeking Young Master Seo Yul.

55:47.385 --> 55:48.511
Seo Yul?

55:48.595 --> 55:50.847
Seo Yul, yeah, don't you know him?

55:52.265 --> 55:54.267
So you must not come from Daeho then.

55:54.893 --> 55:57.479
There isn't a single woman
who doesn't know about him.

55:59.564 --> 56:02.233
I'm sorry but I cannot reveal
a guest information.

56:09.365 --> 56:10.909
I'd like you to tell me more about him.

56:12.202 --> 56:13.036
[chuckles]

56:17.665 --> 56:19.459
Go and see if this is genuine or not.

56:20.251 --> 56:21.252
Yeah.

56:23.129 --> 56:25.799
There are four men
that are from the Daeho Fortress

56:25.882 --> 56:27.592
all the women want to marry.

56:27.675 --> 56:28.510
First off.

56:29.385 --> 56:32.514
[Ju-wol] There's the Crown Prince
who will one day become the king of Daeho.

56:35.016 --> 56:36.309
Crown Prince Go Won.

56:36.893 --> 56:39.938
While he's still unwed,
he's not someone just anyone can marry.

56:41.106 --> 56:43.483
Then there is the new leader of Songrim,

56:43.566 --> 56:46.945
who's from the wealthiest family
in Daeho, Park Dang-gu.

56:48.363 --> 56:51.032
His engagement broke off
at the very last minute.

56:51.116 --> 56:53.034
But such a past is not a deal breaker.

56:53.952 --> 56:56.913
Then there is… Seo Yul.

56:58.081 --> 57:01.793
He's from the most distinguished family
and is perfect in every way.

57:01.876 --> 57:06.005
Well, I guess his only catch is that
Seoho Fortress is far from here.

57:06.756 --> 57:08.883
Finally, Jang Uk.

57:10.009 --> 57:13.513
He is probably the strongest man
in the world right now.

57:13.596 --> 57:15.849
But I wouldn't recommend him.

57:16.349 --> 57:17.183
[Bu-yeon] Why not?

57:17.809 --> 57:19.561
You should never date a man whose past is

57:19.644 --> 57:22.856
as painful as a sword
being plunged into your chest.

57:25.942 --> 57:29.529
So among all of these men,
you came to meet Seo Yul, young lady?

57:30.321 --> 57:31.990
I believe he's who I'm looking for.

57:32.073 --> 57:33.658
When will he be here?

57:33.741 --> 57:37.370
The boat from Seoho Fortress
is arriving any time now. He'll be here.

57:38.705 --> 57:40.915
By the way, how do you know him?

57:42.083 --> 57:44.794
You talked about him being a suitor,
so you've decided?

57:46.671 --> 57:47.797
I don't know yet.

57:48.298 --> 57:51.551
But I'm going to make my decision
once I've met and spoken to him.

57:51.634 --> 57:53.887
Oh, well. aren't you confident?

57:53.970 --> 57:55.388
[Ju-wol chuckles]

57:55.472 --> 57:57.974
He's not someone
you can marry just on good looks.

57:58.057 --> 58:00.268
Which family are you from then?

58:02.854 --> 58:04.147
[worker] Excuse me, Madam.

58:04.230 --> 58:06.232
[suspenseful music playing]

58:10.528 --> 58:14.282
This is indeed authentic,
but this bears the crest of Jinyowon.

58:14.365 --> 58:16.826
She's willing to offer
something so precious?

58:17.869 --> 58:18.912
She must be a thief.

58:23.249 --> 58:24.167
My lady.

58:24.250 --> 58:26.461
What is your relationship to Jinyowon?

58:28.838 --> 58:29.964
How suspicious.

58:30.632 --> 58:33.468
I'll need to go there and see
if this really belongs to you.

58:35.220 --> 58:37.263
Stop her! Stop that thief right now!

58:40.058 --> 58:41.017
Good day, my lord.

58:41.100 --> 58:43.686
- So has Yul arrived yet?
- I think not yet, my lord.

58:44.604 --> 58:45.480
[man grunts]

58:45.563 --> 58:47.565
[thrilling music playing]

58:56.074 --> 58:56.950
[music stops]

59:01.371 --> 59:03.373
[indistinct chatter]

59:04.791 --> 59:06.501
They said he'd be here soon.

59:08.211 --> 59:09.754
Probably from over there.

59:11.464 --> 59:13.299
If he's supposed
to be perfect in every way,

59:14.008 --> 59:15.385
he must be handsome too.

59:22.767 --> 59:25.103
Hi, is your last name Seo?

59:25.895 --> 59:27.438
I'm sorry but I'm not,

59:27.522 --> 59:28.856
although I'd like to know you.

59:28.940 --> 59:30.316
Never mind, just go.

59:42.245 --> 59:44.247
[tense music playing]

59:52.589 --> 59:55.842
[ferryman]
This boat's departing for Bisan-dong.

59:55.925 --> 59:59.053
This boat will be departing shortly
for Bisan-dong.

01:00:18.489 --> 01:00:20.491
[mellow music playing]

01:00:23.911 --> 01:00:25.496
I hope that all has been well.

01:00:27.206 --> 01:00:28.374
Young Master Seo!

01:00:38.176 --> 01:00:40.219
- [passenger] Thanks for the ride!
- [ferryman] See you next time!

01:00:40.303 --> 01:00:41.137
[passenger] See you next time!

01:00:44.724 --> 01:00:47.143
[Bu-yeon] If the man I end up marrying
accepts my mother's wishes,

01:00:47.727 --> 01:00:49.646
I'll be forced to remain
locked up there forever.

01:00:52.023 --> 01:00:54.400
I absolutely must speak
with him before I get caught.

01:00:55.860 --> 01:00:56.694
What do I do?

01:00:58.655 --> 01:01:00.657
[suspenseful music playing]

01:01:06.371 --> 01:01:10.208
Look over there.
Is that not, uh-- That's Jang Uk!

01:01:10.291 --> 01:01:12.210
- [ferryman] Isn't it?
- Yeah, the one with the ice stone.

01:01:12.293 --> 01:01:14.295
[ferryman] Young Master Jang
from the Jang family.

01:01:28.559 --> 01:01:30.269
That man over there is called Jang Uk?

01:01:30.853 --> 01:01:31.854
Yeah.

01:01:31.938 --> 01:01:32.897
Jang Uk.

01:01:35.483 --> 01:01:36.484
The fourth one.

01:01:46.411 --> 01:01:49.914
[Ju-wol] He is probably
the strongest man in the world right now.

01:01:50.498 --> 01:01:52.333
[Bu-yeon] The strongest man in the world?

01:02:06.264 --> 01:02:08.266
[indistinct chatter]

01:02:09.142 --> 01:02:10.059
[customer gasps]

01:02:21.028 --> 01:02:22.947
I heard a rumor that everyone avoids you.

01:02:24.073 --> 01:02:25.366
I guess it's true.

01:02:25.992 --> 01:02:27.201
Looks like you managed to escape.

01:02:27.952 --> 01:02:29.829
So, out for a quick trip?

01:02:31.581 --> 01:02:32.665
Thanks to you.

01:02:34.667 --> 01:02:36.294
[sniffs]

01:02:37.503 --> 01:02:39.172
Something smells delicious here.

01:02:39.255 --> 01:02:41.257
[whimsical music playing]

01:02:44.343 --> 01:02:45.678
You think I can get one of those?

01:02:50.641 --> 01:02:52.602
Forget it. I have no money.

01:02:54.479 --> 01:02:56.355
Here's that strong liquor
you like, my lord.

01:02:58.024 --> 01:02:58.858
Excuse me.

01:03:02.028 --> 01:03:03.362
I'd also like one of those.

01:03:04.071 --> 01:03:05.031
Ah, sure.

01:03:08.993 --> 01:03:10.912
Why, thanks, Jang Uk.

01:03:13.206 --> 01:03:14.332
How do you know what my name is?

01:03:14.415 --> 01:03:18.169
I discovered it by chance
while I was looking for my suitor-to-be.

01:03:19.253 --> 01:03:20.087
Suitor?

01:03:20.171 --> 01:03:22.048
I'm supposed to be getting married soon.

01:03:22.757 --> 01:03:24.383
Jinyowon will become his home afterwards.

01:03:26.552 --> 01:03:28.346
Even ordinary priestesses have
their husbands move in?

01:03:28.429 --> 01:03:32.225
Oh, no. Only the heir of the Jin family
brings her husband to Jinyowon.

01:03:32.308 --> 01:03:34.143
Jin Cho-yeon is the heir
of the Jin family.

01:03:34.769 --> 01:03:36.854
Cho-yeon is the second daughter
of the Jin family.

01:03:38.439 --> 01:03:40.733
The future leader of Jinyowon will be me,

01:03:40.817 --> 01:03:41.984
the rightful heir.

01:03:43.236 --> 01:03:44.153
Jin Bu-yeon.

01:03:48.032 --> 01:03:50.201
What? You say you're who?

01:03:52.662 --> 01:03:54.080
She died a long time ago.

01:03:54.163 --> 01:03:57.792
I already told you that I was someone
who died a long time ago.

01:04:00.419 --> 01:04:02.964
The reason that I was locked up
in that room is because

01:04:03.047 --> 01:04:04.590
I exist when I should not.

01:04:06.926 --> 01:04:11.305
My mother wants my future husband
to move in so I can give birth to an heir.

01:04:12.348 --> 01:04:15.643
If I go through with it, I will be stuck
in that room for the rest of my life.

01:04:15.726 --> 01:04:18.271
You're telling me
that you're really Jin Bu-yeon?

01:04:18.354 --> 01:04:20.523
And that you're running away
because you don't want to be married?

01:04:22.483 --> 01:04:25.194
I'm in no position to run away.
That's why I wanted to find

01:04:25.278 --> 01:04:27.363
my future husband first,
so I can ask for help.

01:04:29.824 --> 01:04:31.784
But I just came up
with this incredible idea!

01:04:34.453 --> 01:04:37.915
I should find a husband
that suits my purpose instead.

01:04:41.002 --> 01:04:42.169
So with that being said,

01:04:43.421 --> 01:04:44.255
Jang Uk…

01:04:45.882 --> 01:04:47.758
will you marry me?

01:04:48.968 --> 01:04:49.802
What?

01:04:49.886 --> 01:04:53.139
I would like for you to become my husband.

01:05:04.775 --> 01:05:07.320
[Dang-gu] There are no mages
training in Jeongjingak anymore.

01:05:08.029 --> 01:05:08.905
Ah…

01:05:10.281 --> 01:05:11.240
Except for Jang Uk.

01:05:12.199 --> 01:05:13.200
Although he's why…

01:05:14.702 --> 01:05:15.536
everyone else left.

01:05:17.246 --> 01:05:18.122
[sighs]

01:05:19.123 --> 01:05:20.416
Then I was the first mage to leave.

01:05:23.377 --> 01:05:24.795
I pretty much ran out of here…

01:05:26.464 --> 01:05:28.299
when you and Uk were struggling so much.

01:05:33.054 --> 01:05:33.888
I'm so sorry.

01:05:38.935 --> 01:05:40.102
You were struggling too.

01:05:43.648 --> 01:05:44.482
You knew the truth…

01:05:46.108 --> 01:05:47.234
about who she really was?

01:05:49.362 --> 01:05:50.655
That she was actually Naksu.

01:05:54.659 --> 01:05:55.493
I did.

01:05:56.077 --> 01:05:57.703
Because even though
Uk was the first person

01:05:57.787 --> 01:05:59.497
to recognize that she was Naksu,

01:06:01.165 --> 01:06:03.417
I was the first person
that met the real Naksu.

01:06:16.555 --> 01:06:17.598
[scoffs]

01:06:18.307 --> 01:06:20.893
You're asking a man you've met
only once if he'd marry you?

01:06:21.686 --> 01:06:23.062
You really are crazy.

01:06:23.145 --> 01:06:24.689
I made a mistake.
I shouldn't have helped you.

01:06:24.772 --> 01:06:27.274
- Clearly, you should still be locked up.
- I'm not losing my mind here.

01:06:27.858 --> 01:06:30.027
You're the only one
strong enough to face my mother.

01:06:30.111 --> 01:06:32.113
You and Jinyowon have bad blood, right?

01:06:32.196 --> 01:06:34.573
If I marry you,
they might just kick me out.

01:06:35.449 --> 01:06:36.993
And that's exactly what I want.

01:06:37.868 --> 01:06:39.870
[quirky music playing]

01:06:39.954 --> 01:06:42.415
I can't believe I found
the perfect prospect on my first try!

01:06:44.542 --> 01:06:45.459
[exhales deeply]

01:06:48.337 --> 01:06:50.673
And I can't believe I ran into
such a crazy potential bride

01:06:50.756 --> 01:06:51.674
who I've only met once.

01:06:52.383 --> 01:06:54.218
- You consider me as a potential bride?
- I don't.

01:06:54.301 --> 01:06:55.428
[loud thud]

01:06:56.012 --> 01:06:57.013
Just look me in the eye.

01:06:58.639 --> 01:07:00.141
Just look and I know you'll reconsider.

01:07:04.979 --> 01:07:07.189
Do you not want to marry me?

01:07:07.273 --> 01:07:09.108
- Why would I?
- Because…

01:07:12.611 --> 01:07:13.738
I'm a rare beauty.

01:07:14.447 --> 01:07:17.533
[whimsical music playing]

01:07:17.616 --> 01:07:18.826
- [distorted music]
- You're driving me crazy.

01:07:19.618 --> 01:07:20.745
There's no way you can deny

01:07:21.454 --> 01:07:24.582
that I'm so beautiful, I turn heads
just by walking down the street.

01:07:28.127 --> 01:07:30.129
I'm sure you're well aware of that.

01:07:30.212 --> 01:07:31.172
Sure, yeah, you're beautiful.

01:07:32.339 --> 01:07:35.342
Use that beauty to find
a better prospective groom out there.

01:07:37.261 --> 01:07:38.679
Enjoy the chicken when it arrives.

01:07:38.763 --> 01:07:39.764
Jang Uk.

01:07:44.018 --> 01:07:44.852
You…

01:07:45.853 --> 01:07:47.646
think that I'm a easy mark
since I listen to you.

01:07:48.689 --> 01:07:49.523
That's enough, okay?

01:07:49.607 --> 01:07:50.941
[approaching footsteps]

01:07:59.033 --> 01:08:02.912
Yeah, that looks good. While you're out,
enjoy yourself before you go back home.

01:08:09.877 --> 01:08:11.170
[sighs]

01:08:12.088 --> 01:08:13.339
[chimes]

01:08:14.215 --> 01:08:15.883
[inhales sharply, groans]

01:08:19.512 --> 01:08:21.347
[sighs]
They'll find me here soon.

01:08:22.098 --> 01:08:23.099
[sighs]

01:08:24.558 --> 01:08:26.811
[indistinct chatter]

01:08:37.988 --> 01:08:40.157
[suspenseful music playing]

01:09:05.391 --> 01:09:06.851
There's something still bothering me.

01:09:08.978 --> 01:09:10.980
Judging from how determined
they are to find you,

01:09:11.897 --> 01:09:13.816
I don't think you're just
some lousy priestess.

01:09:13.899 --> 01:09:16.735
So… you're really Jin Bu-yeon?

01:09:17.444 --> 01:09:19.822
I am. I am Jin Bu-yeon.

01:09:19.905 --> 01:09:21.282
But she went missing years ago.

01:09:21.365 --> 01:09:23.659
She was found three years ago,
and I am her.

01:09:23.742 --> 01:09:25.870
They thought that So-I was
the real daughter as well.

01:09:25.953 --> 01:09:29.415
If I were a fraud, why would they
have kept me hidden for three years?

01:09:30.249 --> 01:09:31.542
I'm really her.

01:09:32.459 --> 01:09:35.171
I mean, Jin Bu-yeon is supposed to have

01:09:36.088 --> 01:09:38.174
the ability to see energy
just like you're able to.

01:09:40.301 --> 01:09:43.387
You… saw the ice stone, didn't you?

01:09:44.096 --> 01:09:47.892
Yeah. I'm the eldest daughter
of Jinyowon with great divine powers.

01:09:48.851 --> 01:09:51.562
If my beauty doesn't sway you,
consider my ability then.

01:09:52.271 --> 01:09:54.064
You never know
when you might need my help someday.

01:09:58.319 --> 01:09:59.153
Fine then.

01:10:00.446 --> 01:10:02.198
If someday I ever need any help from you,

01:10:03.365 --> 01:10:04.325
I know where to find you.

01:10:06.118 --> 01:10:07.494
[Bu-yeon] No, please!

01:10:10.122 --> 01:10:12.082
The wedding will take place
on the full moon.

01:10:12.166 --> 01:10:15.002
If I go through with it,
I'll never leave that room.

01:10:16.545 --> 01:10:18.505
To prevent that,
I need to find a different groom.

01:10:21.926 --> 01:10:24.887
I hope you'll come and take me with you.

01:10:26.388 --> 01:10:27.306
I'll be waiting.

01:10:28.390 --> 01:10:31.185
Please! Please come, okay?

01:10:35.105 --> 01:10:37.024
[chimes]

01:10:38.943 --> 01:10:39.860
[groans softly]

01:10:43.155 --> 01:10:43.989
Jang Uk.

01:10:45.032 --> 01:10:48.327
Everyone goes out of their way
to avoid you.

01:10:49.161 --> 01:10:51.205
You should get married
to someone while they're willing to.

01:10:52.206 --> 01:10:53.874
I told you that I'm willing to marry you.

01:10:56.418 --> 01:10:57.253
No, thanks.

01:11:07.513 --> 01:11:08.847
[female mage] There you are.

01:11:09.431 --> 01:11:10.724
Let's go.

01:11:21.026 --> 01:11:22.528
Have you been keeping well, my lord?

01:11:22.611 --> 01:11:24.822
Hey, I am no longer the leader.

01:11:25.698 --> 01:11:27.157
That man's the leader now.

01:11:28.033 --> 01:11:30.244
Hey… Uncle.

01:11:30.327 --> 01:11:32.621
You know how uncomfortable I feel
whenever anyone calls me that.

01:11:32.705 --> 01:11:34.623
Could you please take
your position back, my lord?

01:11:34.707 --> 01:11:36.500
Then you can let me help
as your assistant and then we can--

01:11:36.583 --> 01:11:37.626
No way!

01:11:37.710 --> 01:11:40.504
Right now, I'm more carefree
than I've been in many years.

01:11:41.088 --> 01:11:42.298
[chuckles]

01:11:43.424 --> 01:11:44.800
So then, what do you do these days?

01:11:44.883 --> 01:11:48.554
Well, I tend the land
and I do my own housework.

01:11:50.055 --> 01:11:50.889
Hey, Yul.

01:11:51.682 --> 01:11:56.353
I have prepared a grand feast for you
to celebrate your return to Songrim.

01:11:57.646 --> 01:12:00.357
Wait, Uncle. Did you cook this feast?

01:12:00.441 --> 01:12:02.026
Your friend should try as well.

01:12:02.860 --> 01:12:06.322
Yul, you'll like it.
[laughs]

01:12:15.205 --> 01:12:17.916
Yeah, he's right.
I can't be his only victim.

01:12:18.000 --> 01:12:20.002
You should try it as well, hmm.

01:12:22.796 --> 01:12:24.631
It looks like
another victim is joining us.

01:12:26.884 --> 01:12:28.719
[emotional music playing]

01:12:37.269 --> 01:12:38.103
You're back.

01:12:43.025 --> 01:12:44.485
Yeah, I'm back.

01:12:46.528 --> 01:12:47.446
[exhales deeply]

01:12:58.207 --> 01:13:00.209
[quirky music playing]

01:13:15.307 --> 01:13:18.936
I dug out the deodeok all by myself,
brushed on a little bit of gochujang,

01:13:20.187 --> 01:13:21.105
charbroiled it.

01:13:21.980 --> 01:13:23.357
Doesn't it smell great?

01:13:24.650 --> 01:13:25.776
[Seo Yul chokes]

01:13:26.735 --> 01:13:27.945
This is deodeok, you say?

01:13:30.948 --> 01:13:32.366
I wouldn't have guessed.

01:13:33.867 --> 01:13:37.204
Yul must have
a very dull palate then, huh?

01:13:37.287 --> 01:13:38.539
[all chuckle awkwardly]

01:13:38.622 --> 01:13:40.207
[Jin] You need to savor it.

01:13:45.212 --> 01:13:46.338
It has an interesting smell.

01:13:50.509 --> 01:13:52.928
I really appreciate
your generosity, my lord.

01:13:54.179 --> 01:13:56.056
But I don't think I can eat another bite.

01:13:56.140 --> 01:13:57.433
[Jin inhales deeply]

01:13:57.516 --> 01:13:58.934
I see, sure…

01:13:59.977 --> 01:14:02.354
Seems like it's not to Yul's liking, huh?

01:14:03.063 --> 01:14:04.148
- [Dang-gu] Right.
- [laughs]

01:14:04.231 --> 01:14:07.359
Dang-gu and Uk here can have the rest.

01:14:07.443 --> 01:14:08.861
[laughs]

01:14:08.944 --> 01:14:11.155
[laughing awkwardly]

01:14:21.206 --> 01:14:23.208
I'm delighted to have
you three sitting here

01:14:23.292 --> 01:14:26.587
- with me after such a long time.
- [Jang Uk] Mm.

01:14:27.463 --> 01:14:28.464
Cheers.

01:14:39.641 --> 01:14:41.393
- Eat up! Go on.
- Eat up now!

01:14:46.565 --> 01:14:47.566
[Cho-yeon] You're saying

01:14:48.233 --> 01:14:50.527
the news of our wedding here
got to Dang-gu?

01:14:51.111 --> 01:14:52.112
Yes.

01:14:52.196 --> 01:14:54.823
I heard that he kept asking
who was getting married.

01:14:56.241 --> 01:14:57.075
[sighs]

01:14:58.702 --> 01:15:00.454
Since he doesn't know about Bu-yeon,

01:15:01.038 --> 01:15:02.915
he would think it's my wedding.

01:15:10.339 --> 01:15:12.925
I loved you, Cho-yeon.

01:15:13.884 --> 01:15:17.262
[sobs]
You gotta be happy!

01:15:19.014 --> 01:15:20.641
[wailing]
Cho-yeon.

01:15:20.724 --> 01:15:24.436
No, I don't want you
to be happy without me…

01:15:24.520 --> 01:15:26.021
I'll take him back to his room
and get him to bed.

01:15:26.104 --> 01:15:26.939
All right.

01:15:27.940 --> 01:15:30.400
- [Dang-gu wails in distance]
- Bye then.

01:15:34.988 --> 01:15:36.198
Poor Dang-gu.

01:15:37.241 --> 01:15:38.742
Just look at how drunk he got.

01:15:39.993 --> 01:15:43.330
The wedding that's happening in Jinyowon
Sang-ho was talking about must be true.

01:15:47.167 --> 01:15:50.128
Jinyowon is really hosting a wedding soon?

01:15:50.712 --> 01:15:53.131
They say they've been bringing in
everything they need for the wedding.

01:15:53.924 --> 01:15:55.801
For the past three years,
they've kept their gates barred

01:15:55.884 --> 01:15:57.302
and wouldn't let anyone in.

01:15:57.886 --> 01:15:59.471
I suppose they are trying
to hold the wedding

01:15:59.555 --> 01:16:01.139
with as little attention as it can get.

01:16:04.810 --> 01:16:06.895
Do you know
who in the Jin family is getting married?

01:16:06.979 --> 01:16:08.230
Jin Cho-yeon, probably.

01:16:09.314 --> 01:16:12.234
She's that family's only daughter,
after all.

01:16:13.735 --> 01:16:15.404
Isn't Jin Bu-yeon
the eldest daughter though?

01:16:15.487 --> 01:16:17.072
But Jin Bu-yeon is dead.

01:16:17.614 --> 01:16:20.993
She died while retrieving the ice stone
that was sealed in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho

01:16:21.702 --> 01:16:23.287
when its waters swept her away.

01:16:23.370 --> 01:16:24.538
Her father confessed to us…

01:16:25.998 --> 01:16:27.708
about what really happened before he died.

01:16:29.376 --> 01:16:31.795
Her death… what a shame.

01:16:32.379 --> 01:16:35.173
She showed such promise
of divine powers at such a young age.

01:16:36.341 --> 01:16:38.051
I can only imagine
that she would've grown up

01:16:38.135 --> 01:16:41.054
to be as powerful as Jin Seol-ran,
Jinyowon's first leader.

01:16:43.807 --> 01:16:44.641
If there's…

01:16:46.143 --> 01:16:47.936
a priestess as powerful as Jin Seol-ran,

01:16:49.938 --> 01:16:52.441
will she be able
to extract the ice stone from within me?

01:16:53.442 --> 01:16:54.651
Even if she were able,

01:16:55.694 --> 01:16:56.945
do you want to have it removed?

01:17:03.201 --> 01:17:06.872
Right now, the only reason you're alive
is thanks to that stone's power.

01:17:07.456 --> 01:17:08.457
But you told me

01:17:09.291 --> 01:17:12.085
it had to be destroyed
because no human can handle its power.

01:17:13.587 --> 01:17:14.421
Yes.

01:17:15.464 --> 01:17:16.632
You were absolutely right.

01:17:18.133 --> 01:17:19.217
It's become too much…

01:17:21.386 --> 01:17:22.220
for me to handle.

01:17:27.809 --> 01:17:29.186
Maidservant Kim had told me…

01:17:30.771 --> 01:17:33.774
even looking at you brings her pain
as it seems like you still have

01:17:33.857 --> 01:17:35.984
a sword buried deep
within that chest of yours.

01:17:37.611 --> 01:17:38.945
Do you still feel its pain?

01:17:41.490 --> 01:17:42.866
I should have just died back then.

01:17:43.492 --> 01:17:45.202
Dying right then and there is the most…

01:17:46.536 --> 01:17:48.705
that any real human is
ever able to handle.

01:17:49.289 --> 01:17:51.124
Do you really think that
removing the ice stone…

01:17:52.501 --> 01:17:55.295
would also remove the sword that's still
buried deep within your chest?

01:17:57.297 --> 01:17:59.925
["Love letter" by BIG Naughty playing]

01:18:01.468 --> 01:18:04.346
But if you… if you try and remove it,

01:18:05.972 --> 01:18:06.890
you will die.

01:18:10.769 --> 01:18:11.603
At least then…

01:18:14.815 --> 01:18:17.693
I will be lifting the weight
that's right on my shoulders.

01:18:29.287 --> 01:18:31.915
["Love letter" continues playing]

01:18:39.881 --> 01:18:40.757
[sighs]

01:19:26.762 --> 01:19:29.014
Uncle Yun-o,
so you're here to get married?

01:19:30.140 --> 01:19:31.808
But you never told me anything about that.

01:19:32.976 --> 01:19:36.062
It was meant to remain a secret,
so I couldn't say anything.

01:19:37.439 --> 01:19:39.941
Well, so tonight,
Jinyowon's eldest daughter,

01:19:40.025 --> 01:19:41.485
Jin Bu-yeon, will be my bride.

01:19:42.736 --> 01:19:43.862
[scoffs]

01:19:43.945 --> 01:19:45.947
[pensive music playing]

01:19:49.367 --> 01:19:52.245
It's our tradition for the bride
to get married at the groom's home,

01:19:52.996 --> 01:19:55.040
and then the two of you will come here.

01:20:03.924 --> 01:20:04.841
What is that?

01:20:05.926 --> 01:20:07.260
A petal?

01:20:08.178 --> 01:20:10.222
It came to me
when I was at my most desperate.

01:20:12.849 --> 01:20:14.351
I hope it will come back to me soon.

01:20:17.229 --> 01:20:21.024
No matter what,
you cannot think about running away.

01:20:22.943 --> 01:20:23.777
I know.

01:20:24.736 --> 01:20:25.737
I'll just keep waiting.

01:20:26.404 --> 01:20:28.824
Waiting? For who?

01:20:31.326 --> 01:20:32.452
For my husband.

01:20:35.497 --> 01:20:38.458
[Bu-yeon]
Please come and take me with you.

01:20:45.590 --> 01:20:47.592
[pensive music playing]

01:21:05.652 --> 01:21:07.654
The bride must have left Jinyowon.

01:21:08.363 --> 01:21:09.447
She will be here soon.

01:21:11.950 --> 01:21:14.828
Is he the one
Bu-yeon will get married to tonight?

01:21:14.911 --> 01:21:15.745
Yes.

01:21:16.246 --> 01:21:19.541
He's the younger cousin of General Seo
as well as the Queen of Daeho.

01:21:20.125 --> 01:21:23.295
He lost both of his parents
so he has no one to rely on at all.

01:21:24.629 --> 01:21:26.798
Jinyowon's strength is
something that he needs,

01:21:27.382 --> 01:21:29.718
so he'll do perfect for us.

01:21:34.014 --> 01:21:35.015
[Cho-yeon] That person there

01:21:35.724 --> 01:21:38.393
will never be able
to free my sister from this place.

01:21:40.896 --> 01:21:41.730
[sighs]

01:21:55.702 --> 01:21:57.078
Guess he's not coming.

01:21:59.581 --> 01:22:01.583
[somber music playing]

01:22:26.316 --> 01:22:28.568
[dramatic music playing]

01:22:29.611 --> 01:22:31.863
[wind howling]

01:22:36.284 --> 01:22:37.410
[gasps]

01:22:53.301 --> 01:22:55.303
[soft music playing]

01:23:06.231 --> 01:23:07.190
[soft chuckle]

01:23:34.509 --> 01:23:35.343
I knew it.

01:23:36.177 --> 01:23:37.387
I knew you'd come for me.

01:23:38.555 --> 01:23:39.973
I thought I might need your help.

01:23:40.557 --> 01:23:42.183
I told you I'd be useful to you.

01:23:49.024 --> 01:23:50.275
Come on.

01:23:50.358 --> 01:23:51.192
All right.

01:23:55.947 --> 01:23:57.949
Let's go now, my husband.

01:24:04.622 --> 01:24:05.665
[sighs]

01:24:07.167 --> 01:24:09.252
[romantic music playing]

01:24:22.724 --> 01:24:24.726
["I′m Sorry" by Ailee playing]

01:25:04.390 --> 01:25:07.310
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:25:08.103 --> 01:25:10.271
I have no memories at all before Jinyowon.

01:25:11.147 --> 01:25:13.274
Search this place thoroughly
for Park Dang-gu at once.

01:25:13.358 --> 01:25:15.568
But I thought that it was
Young Lady Cho-yeon's wedding.

01:25:15.652 --> 01:25:17.612
[Dang-gu] And I did want to run over
and ruin the ceremony, 

01:25:17.695 --> 01:25:19.197
but I didn't do that.

01:25:19.280 --> 01:25:20.115
WHOEVER FINDS THIS LADY
WILL BE REWARDED GENEROUSLY

01:25:20.198 --> 01:25:22.826
Bu-yeon's existence has finally
been revealed to the whole world.

01:25:23.368 --> 01:25:25.912
That rare beauty
could take out the ice stone for you?

01:25:27.122 --> 01:25:29.999
[Seo Yul] I was just wondering if,
by any chance, we've met before?

01:25:30.959 --> 01:25:33.753
[Bu-yeon] So what is it then
that you want from me?

01:25:34.254 --> 01:25:37.340
[Jang Uk] As long as you still have
your powers, that is what I need from you.
